    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "For a rare pediatric liver tumour we want a regulatory network per biopsy that includes both TFs and miRNAs, using LIONESS-PUMA with our motif, PPI, miRNA-target prior and miRNA list. Depending on whether one borderline biopsy passes RNA quality control, we will have either two or three samples. I don't know yet which it will be."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Will the borderline biopsy pass RNA quality control?\n  You wrote: \"Depending on whether one borderline biopsy passes RNA quality control, we will have either two or three samples\". LIONESS-PUMA's contract: \"Require at least three expression samples and a validated one-ID-per-line miRNA list\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
